cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EtaDecayer, please cite it as below, together with the physics inputs listed in README.md."
title: "EtaDecayer: an exclusive eta/eta' decayer for Pythia 8"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lai
    given-names: Yihui
  - family-names: Qian
    given-names: Sitian
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/yihui-lai/EtaDecayer"
abstract: >-
  A Pythia 8 DecayHandler that decays every eta or eta' in an event into one chosen exclusive final state
  (mu+ mu-, l+ l- gamma, mu+ mu- e+ e-, 4e, 4mu, pi+ pi- l+ l-, eta pi pi, l+ l- A, pi+ pi- A)
keywords:
  - Pythia 8
  - eta meson
  - eta prime meson
  - rare decays
  - transition form factor
  - Monte Carlo event generator
